5,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I believe we should start by grounding our expectations in reality. I'll look into the condition of works from the earlier programme and the record of the eastern avenue planting to see what actually lasts.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I agree with Benjamin's caution. I'll check the regional firms tendering for earth-moving and the depot phasing notes on hoarding the site to see how feasible the construction actually is.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Mio,,I want to make sure we can actually afford to keep the park beautiful! I'll look into the upkeep ledger spend per hectare and the terms of the regional habitat fund.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"I will examine the groundskeeping roll and bought-in services, as well as the volunteer groups working with the division, to understand who will actually maintain the site.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,I'll focus on the practical usage and environmental factors. I will look into the timed counts of weekday crossings and the drainage callouts and August heat readings.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"It seems we have a comprehensive spread of research. @Misaki, do you think the phasing notes will reveal any specific constraints that might limit our choice of plan?","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"Possibly. If the site cannot be hoarded in certain areas, it might make more complex designs a nightmare to implement without closing the whole park. I'm curious to see the specifics.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Mio,,I'm just worried that we'll pick something that looks amazing in a drawing but then costs a fortune to maintain! I hope the fund terms give us some good options.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Asuka,,Maintenance is often the first thing neglected in these plans. I want to see if the current staffing levels can even support a more complex design without relying on external contractors.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minako,,"That is a valid point, @Asuka. I suspect the actual flow of people and the drainage issues will tell us if a design is fighting the land or working with it.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"I suspect we will find a discrepancy between the vision and the reality. @Minako, if the drainage is as poor as I suspect, it might render some of the more ambitious landscaping plans quite impractical.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"Exactly. If the ground is unstable or the drainage is failing, we can't just ignore it for the sake of a pretty picture. I'll be interested to see if the firms are already wary of the soil.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Mio,,"I just hope we don't find out that the budget is way too tight! @Benjamin, do you think the previous works you're checking will show us where the city usually cuts corners?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"That is exactly what I am hoping to find. If the city consistently underfunds the operational side, we must prioritize a plan that doesn't require a massive, non-existent workforce to survive.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minako,,"I agree. We need a design that respects the physical reality of the site and the habits of the people using it, rather than forcing a new behavior on the public.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I think we have a solid plan for this round. Let's proceed with these investigations so we can bring the facts to the table before we see the candidates.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
